! @elyncia-referee

The referee tier of the Elyncia domain. This bag layers over `@elyncia` in referee recipes and
holds what players must not read: NPC private truths, sealed hooks, dossier logic. ''cap-tier''
tightens to `contract` — the referee's own hands and whichever seats the operator contracts in.
Every meme here rides rating `kapu` or `data`; nothing federates to a player-facing render.

